        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kagan tingkum hei tat the,",
            "Rianra bammei nun guai ni;",
            "Neiriu gaimei kandih munpuang guai,",
            "Matat khat nakhou man dat nimei ram e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He atingsang namdai neila pui ram,",
            "Kanloumei nanun bampui ram ai juanni;",
            "Rianramei le mikdui kei mei,",
            "Nai dat lakkhe kapmei rianramei guai.",
            "",
            "2. He kandih rianramei le,",
            "Mikdui ruina luang liam lou;",
            "Riannra kalang bampui ram khou hei,",
            "Pat louna tat ni e kanloumei ram khou.",
            "",
            "3. Rianramei guai tuan lana,",
            "Kandih munpuang gaimei guai ni;",
            "Kandih neilamei guai man puni,",
            "Munpuang kummei tingsang ramta ai ninge."
          ]
        }
      },
